<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us</title>
    <style>
        body{
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-color: rgb(78, 78, 78);
            color: white;
            width: 100vw;
        }
        main{
            width: 100%;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        header{
            margin-top: 30px;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header p{
            padding-left: 15vw;
            padding-right: 15vw;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .one{
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 5vw;
        }
        .right,.left{
            width: 50%;
            padding: 3vw;
        }
        .left img{
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .right p{
            font-size: larger;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .two{
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .profile{
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            width: 30%;
            padding-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .image{
            height: 140px;
            width: 140px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: contain;
            background-color: rgb(255, 221, 127);
            padding: 3px;
        }
        img{
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .about{
            text-align: center;
        }
        .details{
            font-family: 'Times New Roman';
        }
        footer{
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: monospace;
            color: rgb(195, 195, 195);
            border-top: 1px solid rgb(173, 173, 173);
        }
        @media only screen and (width < 800px) {
            .one{
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .right,.left{
                width: 80%;
            }
            .two{
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .profile{
                width: 80%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main style="font-family: 'Gill Sans', 'Gill Sans MT', Calibri, 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; line-height: 30px;">
        <header>
            <h1>Welcome to Department of C.S , SDVM</h1>
            <p>The pre-primary school called Saraswati Sishu Mandir came to exist in the year 1979.</p>
        </header>
        <section class="one">
            <div class="left"><img src="/images/SDVM.jpg" alt=""></div>
            <div class="right">
                <p style="font-family: 'Gill Sans', 'Gill Sans MT', Calibri, 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; line-height: 30px;">
                    It is a co-educational self-financed institution established in 1979, registered under Society Registration Act 1860 to impart national class quality education. The institution has got permission, recognition and affiliation from Govt. of Odisha having sanctioned strength of 512 seats for +2 Science, 128 for +2 Commerce and 256 seats for +3 Science Hons. affiliated under Berhampur University. Saraswati Sishu Vidya Mandir affiliated to Sikshya Vikash Samiti, Bhubaneswar and Vidya Bharati. The institution has its own land and excellent infrastructure.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="two">
            <div class="profile">
                <div class="image">
                    <img src="/images/Santosh_sir.jpg" alt="teacher">
                </div>
                <div class="about">
                    <h3 class="name">Mr. Santosh Ku. Raul</h3>
                    <p class="details"><strong>HOD of Comp. Sc. </strong> (17 Years Exp) M. Tech</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="profile">
                <div class="image">
                    <img src="/images/KAILASH NAYAK.jpg" alt="teacher">
                </div>
                <div class="about">
                    <h3 class="name">Mr. Kailash Ch. Nayak</h3>
                    <p class="details"><strong>Dept. of Comp. Sc. </strong> (10 Years Exp) M.Sc, M.Tech</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="profile">
                <div class="image">
                    <img src="/images/Bhagaban Muduli.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="about">
                    <h3 class="name">Mr. Bhagaban Muduli</h3>
                    <p class="details"><strong>Dept. of Comp. Sc. </strong> (13 Years Exp)MCA, M.Tech</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <footer>
            <h4>&copy;copyright | 2025 | Computer Sc. SDVM, Nknagar</h4>
            <a
        style="
          color: white;
          padding: 4px 10px;
          text-decoration: none;
          background-color: rgb(85, 85, 226);
          border-radius: 8px;
          width: 130px;
          position: absolute;
          top: 10px;
          right: 10px;
        "
        href="/"
        >Back to Home page</a
      >
        </footer>
    </main>
</body>
</html>